# Moonlight Syndrome (SLPS-01001), the chapter in SHITSOW.DAT on disc 2 (SLPS-01002). This chapter's kanji and
# marks, 0x0100-0x0273, in the order of the chapter's font on the disc (the archive's entry 3); 16-bit codes, high
# byte first. Goes after tables/human-kana.tbl (the codes every chapter shares).
